  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">220/66 kV Electrical Transmission Development (Phase IV) Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at meeting the increasing demand for electricity by reinforcing the 220/66 kV Transmission Network within the national grid in order to absorb the newly generated power capacity from the new generation plants to the load centres.</narrative>
